<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50734" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππο-βότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόσκω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeder of horses</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀτρεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., but prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βώτα</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				1059
			</span></i> (but prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βάτας</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱπποβόται, οἱ</span>, at Chalcis in Euboea a social class (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <u>Knights</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.100
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἱπποβοτῶν πολιτεία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					603
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
